load @term/seed/code/structure/field
  find field

# A field extension: a larger field containing a smaller one, the way the complex numbers extend the reals by adjoining
# a square root of minus one. The extension's dimension as a vector space over the base is its degree. Galois theory
# studies the symmetries of an extension, the permutations of the new roots that fix the base. The complex numbers are
# the degree-two extension of the reals, the first step of the tower. The form carries the base and the extending field.
form field-extension
  link base, like field
  link extension, like field
